    {
      "source": "As of 5.0.3 subclasses should implement this method instead of\n<code>#validateRequestInternal(ClientHttpRequest)</code> in order to match the\nrequest to an expectation, leaving the call to create the response as a separate step\n(to be invoked by this class).",
      "translation": "自 5.0.3 版本起，子类应实现此方法以替代<code>#validateRequestInternal(ClientHttpRequest)</code>来匹配请求预期，而将创建响应的调用作为单独步骤保留（由本类调用）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked at the time of the first actual request, which effectively means\nthe expectations declaration phase is over.",
      "translation": "在实际请求首次发出时调用，这实际上意味着期望声明阶段已经结束。",
      "count": 2
